1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,410
In the year 897,

2
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:02,490
Pope Stephen VI

3
00:00:02,490 --> 00:00:03,530
put his dead predecessor

4
00:00:03,530 --> 00:00:04,850
on trial for real.

5
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:06,050
Nine months after

6
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:07,270
Pope Formosus died,

7
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:08,590
guards dug up his corpse

8
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:09,510
and dressed the skeleton

9
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:10,610
in gold robes.

10
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:11,700
They propped him

11
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:12,120
on a throne

12
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:13,360
and appointed a trembling

13
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,540
young deacon to answer

14
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:15,700
as his defence lawyer.

15
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:16,940
The silent skeleton

16
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:18,080
still lost the case,

17
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:19,120
had his three blessing

18
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:20,100
fingers chopped off,

19
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,500
and was stripped of his title.

20
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:22,850
After his body was

21
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:24,170
tossed into the Tiber River,

22
00:00:24,370 --> 00:00:25,650
Rome rebelled and banned

23
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:26,550
putting dead people

24
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:27,550
on trial forever.
